---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="A little about Ankit.">
  <section class="page-hero reveal reveal-1">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>One small internet corner, kept close to the files.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Hi, I'm Ankit. I build small things and write about what I learn along
      the way.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="split-section reveal reveal-2">
    <article class="prose">
      <p>
        This site is the place where it all lives: the experiments, the
        half-finished ideas, and the occasional finished one. It's a notebook in
        public, written in Markdown and
        <a href="https://github.com/nnnkit/ankit.md">built in the open</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>What belongs here</h2>
      <p>
        Notes that sharpen into essays, tools small enough to understand, and
        project logs that keep the work honest.
      </p>
    </article>

    <aside class="aside-panel" aria-labelledby="elsewhere">
      <h2 id="elsewhere">Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/nnnkit">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://x.com/nnnkit">X / Twitter</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:iankit17@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </section>
</Base>
